    "riichi_mahjong_forge.advancement.sankantsu.description": "集齐三组杠子并和牌。",
    "riichi_mahjong_forge.advancement.sanshoku_doujun.description": "集齐万、筒、索三种花色中数字相同的顺子并和牌。",
